{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56563","headline":"火记歌（幷序） 五 · 韩蕴中","name":"火记歌（幷序） 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万木尽含阳，花开满路香。\n金鸡乘大火，（朱火精。\n）玉兔却亏伤。\n（水精。\n）至士忧生死，尊卑倐忽亡。\n药成朝大帝，服饵灭灾殃。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩蕴中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56563.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56563","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}